Another type of power-law behavior of higher-order \(F_{q}(M)\) versus second-order \(F_{2}(M)\) is defined as: [69, 70, 71, 72]:

\[F_{q}(M)\propto F_{2}(M)^{\beta_{q}},M\gg 1, \tag{9}\]

